{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, with uncontrollable events for obstacle sensing and controllable events for motion. The specification enforces safe exploration: move_forward is only allowed when the path is clear; any obstacle event triggers a rotate_clockwise recovery, and forward progress resumes only after path_clear. The design is deterministic, never stalls, and always prefers forward motion when safe, using rotate_clockwise as the only recovery/turn action.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion-perception and specification for safe exploration policy.",
    "Always-turn-right policy: rotate_clockwise is the only allowed turn/recovery; move_forward is only enabled in clear state."
  ],
